{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206260","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1120626001:0":{"text":"センシグ、ここが君の言ってた合流場所だよね？友だちは？","source_cn":"切西格，你说的汇合地就是这里吧，你的朋友呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE1385066A3B739E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120626002:0":{"text":"友だち？もう来ていますよ。","source_cn":"我的朋友？已经来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x296062A636F567C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120626003:0":{"text":"みなさんが――僕の大事な友だち、僕にとっての金の風見鶏です！ここまで来てくれて、本当にありがとうございます！","source_cn":"你们——我宝贵的朋友，金子铸成的风向标！感谢你们愿意来这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E284E7314E257C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120626004:1":{"text":"なんだ、なんだ……何を言っているんだ？","source_cn":"什么什么……你说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FE2BEF5D9A3458A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1120626004":{"text":"なんだ、なんだ……何を言っているんだ？","source_cn":"什么什么……你说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FE2BEF5D9A3458A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120626005:1":{"text":"……えっ！？","source_cn":"……啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7C7ED0BE994F0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120626006:0":{"text":"まだわかってないのか、アウェン。","source_cn":"艾文，你的反应可比旁边这位朋友迟钝多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x445159080202FDE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120626007:0":{"text":"そののろまな反応で……いったいどうやってプーバたちを倒したんだ？","source_cn":"就凭你这后知后觉的反应……真不知道你们是怎么干掉蒲巴他们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BBB5AA0222E02C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120626008:0":{"text":"苦労してここまで連れてきたんだ。今度こそ絶対に逃がすものか。","source_cn":"我费了这么大力气，总算把你们带到这里了。这次你们别想跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6418D115C5F57EFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120626009:0":{"text":"お前は……僕たちを襲った盗賊の一味だったのか！","source_cn":"你和之前抢劫我们的匪徒……是一伙的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB65B258F84BA91A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120626010:1":{"text":"やはりお前はあの盗賊どものボスだったのだな！","source_cn":"果然，你才是那些盗匪的首领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D01813E2E2806AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120626011:0":{"text":"財宝はどこだ？俺様が「二十頭の鋼顎獣でようやく運べる財宝」を手に入れることができれば、命だけは許してやる……","source_cn":"宝藏在哪儿？等我拿到“二十只钢颚兽才能驮动的宝藏”，心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x976B54150C434AF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120626012:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120626013:0":{"text":"言わないのか？もしかして逃げようとでも？ハハハッ！こっちは大勢いるんだ。逃げるのは無理だぜ！","source_cn":"不说话？打逃跑的主意？哈哈哈，我们的人很多，你们是跑不掉的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF11688C6A50BA313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120626014:0":{"text":"――かかれ！","source_cn":"——上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97D3742B039FDC21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"やはりセンシグは盗賊だった。","source_cn":"果然，切西格是盗匪","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD01AA2657D5FE2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"やはりセンシグは盗賊だった。","female":"やはりセンシグは盗賊だった。","variant_male_record_index":"64446","